{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a casual solo card game with rogue-like elements set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.<br><br><strong>What's Included</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neophyte (Single Trial with reduced cards and no Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adeptus (Single Trial with Standard Rules and no Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hierophant Journey (Endless Trial Rooms, Standard Rules and Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Aspect Cards to Collect through various Floors (Available in Journey Only)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612900?t=1759023839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/cc11e603ded4d4bcc7d4390994418407409d43d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759023839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/24a86fb8096e47111146d91f69860f7fc66fda68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759023839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/24a86fb8096e47111146d91f69860f7fc66fda68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759023839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"LOST ALTR contains themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all players. This includes dark esoteric symbolism, references to ritual practices, bloodletting, and self-sacrifice. Player discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":3681250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a casual solo card game with rogue-like elements set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.<br><br><strong>What's Included</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neophyte (Single Trial with reduced cards and no Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adeptus (Single Trial with Standard Rules and no Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hierophant Journey (Endless Trial Rooms, Standard Rules and Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Aspect Cards to Collect through various Floors (Available in Journey Only)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>","developers":["ALTER-BOY"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},